    "body": "## Scope\n\n- add a `Ник` field to the start screen and feed it into the existing `getStartName` path\n- show `Райхан` instead of `Кен` and `Настя` instead of `Мика` while preserving stable internal IDs and branch IDs\n- add a clear explanation before the six-question evidence gate\n- bump the visible test label to Stage 7.4\n- keep source/docs mirrors identical\n\n## Exact diff\n\nExactly five files:\n\n- `AsyncScene/Web/index.html`\n- `docs/index.html`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-stage7-personalization.js`\n- `docs/ui/ui-stage7-personalization.js`\n- `tools/test_stage7_4_personalization.py`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `STAGE7_4_PERSONALIZATION_OK`\n- Node parse PASS for both JS mirrors\n- source/docs JS parity PASS\n- source/docs index parity PASS\n- `git diff --check` PASS\n- no network APIs in the personalization layer\n\nLegacy Stage 7.1/7.2 validators contain superseded exact cache-buster assertions and already fail on unchanged `main@6b41ea366633d76bf1cb04aea854fe237142ad0c`; this PR therefore uses a focused Stage 7.4 contract test rather than pretending those stale checks are meaningful.",
    "changed_files": 5,
